# The request is intentionally empty because chair selection is config-driven.
---
# The service reports whether an empty chair was found.
bool success
# The service also returns a short human-readable status message.
string message
# The service returns the chosen chair id from the receptionist layout config.
string chair_id
# The service returns the base-facing pose for the chosen chair.
geometry_msgs/PoseStamped chair_pose
# The service returns the safe pre-calibrated waist yaw for the chosen chair.
float32 waist_yaw_rad
